question:
Here is a Python function and an input. Predict the exact value that the function returns for this input.

```python
def f(text, res):
    for c in '*\n"':
        text = text.replace(c, '!' + str(res))
    if text.startswith('!'):
        text = text[len(str(res)):]
    return text
```

Input: f('"Leap and the net will appear', 123)
